{"h":3406,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Sample answers tor Writing tasks","x":0.074226799167011942,"w":0.3360824839274088,"h":0.017615971814445075,"y":0.05226071614284622,"c":1},{"w":0.38350514729817708,"y":0.10029069818978598,"h":0.020378708629417708,"c":1,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 1","x":0.070103096351474783},{"y":0.13799177912781868,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.21649485270182295,"x":0.070103089009913314,"c":1,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER"},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6 score. Here is the","y":0.1758661185861603,"h":0.015994346358813916,"x":0.072164945989358575,"c":1,"w":0.83917526245117169},{"w":0.21649485270182295,"x":0.072164944391356581,"c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562,"y":0.19318849062283394,"t":"examiner's comment:"},{"h":0.017615971814445186,"w":0.8391752624511718,"y":0.22959483283849813,"x":0.11958763361977474,"t":"The candidate covers all the key features of the task and rounds off the description","c":1},{"y":0.25000000016712298,"x":0.119587620637881,"w":0.77938145955403659,"h":0.016001174398120988,"t":"with an overview. There is some repetition of information and some irrelevant","c":1},{"t":"commentary (which is good because it shows that more people have learned other","h":0.017441859892096456,"c":1,"x":0.11958762219709457,"y":0.26744186057720754,"w":0.83917526245117191},{"x":0.11752576129501847,"w":0.79587631225585942,"c":1,"y":0.28772753973804566,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"languages well). Information is arranged coherently and there is a clear overail"},{"h":0.017447835056486394,"w":0.79587631225585931,"t":"progression, with effective use of cohesive devices, though there is a tendency","y":0.30668604623513396,"c":1,"x":0.11958761698191742},{"t":"to rely on dates. The range of vocabulary is adequate for the task, but the writer","x":0.11958763376804191,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"w":0.80618555704752615,"y":0.32558139539846642},{"c":1,"t":"does not attempt any less common items. There is a mix of simple and complex","x":0.1215800185960046,"y":0.34175853754792351,"w":0.80220189412434895,"h":0.017232025782640492},{"t":"sentence forms, with a fair degree of accuracy, but the range would need to be","x":0.11958762379402903,"y":0.36046511600293218,"c":1,"h":0.017441861012089888,"w":0.79381444295247394},{"y":0.37654356756957541,"h":0.021885433409820187,"c":1,"w":0.3244038899739583,"t":"wider to achieve a higher score.","x":0.1192994694860901},{"w":0.8125791422526043,"h":0.022280408015897923,"c":1,"y":0.41511297235132782,"t":"The charts shaw the percentage of the British students, who are able to speak","x":0.070002364824753444},{"w":0.87861419677734376,"y":0.43286667323698769,"h":0.023577727644288116,"t":"languages ocher than English, in 2000 and in 2010. In 2000, 20% of the British","x":0.067925678772887937,"c":1},{"t":"students were not. able to speak another langunge. But in 2010 the number has","x":0.068041241996834104,"y":0.45494186018801086,"w":0.80618555704752604,"h":0.017459783705276344,"c":1},{"w":0.87216491699218757,"c":1,"x":0.068041252750783293,"y":0.47383720902640958,"t":"decreased to 10%, which is good because it shaws that. more people have learned other","h":0.017441861012089888},{"c":1,"y":0.493083387503093,"t":"languages well.","x":0.067959540923702516,"w":0.1445419692993164,"h":0.017345250387858169},{"t":"The biggest percentage had Spanish only with 30% in 2000. Hawever it has","x":0.06597938631538397,"w":0.80618555704752604,"h":0.019083969465648942,"y":0.51879036946398527,"c":1},{"t":"increased by 5% and is in 2010 st.ill the highest percentage with 35%.","y":0.53633720914270899,"w":0.74845362345377597,"c":1,"x":0.065979373761800936,"h":0.018895349149765539},{"y":0.56230622782797746,"w":0.82279652913411461,"c":1,"t":"In 2000, German onky and two other languages were the lawest ones, both with","h":0.021372505586705892,"x":0.067972943136956024},{"x":0.065979397071411081,"t":"10%. While in 2010 French only. German only and two ot.her langunges show the lawest","h":0.017615971814445186,"w":0.87216491699218746,"c":1,"y":0.58279506773417145},{"w":0.82886596679687519,"y":0.60029069747090202,"h":0.018910712098207383,"t":"percenkage, while all of them got 10%. All in all, the percentage of German onky in","c":1,"x":0.068041243178882105},{"c":1,"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"2000 and 2010 hasn't. changed. The percentage of French onky has decreased by 5%.","x":0.068041222364024823,"y":0.61918604635226226,"w":0.86597941080729157},{"h":0.022719073561591641,"c":1,"w":0.84971577962239597,"t":"No other languages percentage was reduced by the half: from, the 20% in 2000 to","x":0.067936501467344881,"y":0.63507163041746773},{"t":"10% in 2010..","x":0.066717847178545064,"c":1,"w":0.15448036193847656,"y":0.64729967043953873,"h":0.031090188152427478},{"h":0.018895349149765539,"t":"The number of people, who are speaking two other languages has increased by half:","y":0.68313953472506295,"c":1,"x":0.065979373998428917,"w":0.83298970540364592},{"x":0.070103098794464996,"c":1,"y":0.70052847907110327,"w":0.54432988484700529,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"In 2000 there were 10% and in 2010 khere are 15%."},{"y":0.72812683468110928,"h":0.019083969465648831,"c":1,"x":0.070103098926712737,"w":0.82886596679687496,"t":"Another interesting fact is that the percentage of another language has improved"},{"t":"aswelt: from 15% t.o 20%.","x":0.068041235997912022,"y":0.74709302329964811,"w":0.26185567220052086,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"h":0.018895349149765539,"c":1,"x":0.070103085322824554,"y":0.77325581379449548,"w":0.83298970540364592,"t":"But still, the most cormon learned langunge is Spariish only: In 2000 there were"},{"h":0.018929488786304294,"w":0.80618555704752604,"x":0.070103097953900143,"y":0.79066353446832649,"c":1,"t":"30% of English students, who spoke it fvently, whike in 2010 the number has"},{"w":0.26597938537597654,"c":1,"y":0.80945390489107771,"x":0.065979379434348479,"t":"increased further to 35%.","h":0.013220513769968467},{"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.96075581384989772,"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343103,"t":"134","x":0.065979382159514016},{"h":0.0241457972187753,"y":0.95282647550815269,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.35215498527080541,"c":1,"w":0.29360280354817708}]}